<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <h2 style="color: #333;">Reset Your {{companyName}} Password</h2>
  <p>Hi {{userName}},</p>

  <p>You requested a password reset. Click the button below to reset your password:</p>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
    <a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="background-color: #4a90e2; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px;">
      Reset Password
    </a>
  </div>

  <p><strong>This link will expire in {{expiryMinutes}} minutes.</strong></p>

  <p>If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

  <hr style="margin: 30px 0; border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eee;" />

  <p style="color: #777; font-size: 12px;">{{companyName}} Zuno HR - Empowering Human Resource Management</p>
</div>
